id: pm-1vx6
title: Preset apply bypasses workspace settings history and leaves strict health failing
description: "Packed pm-presets on published PM CLI 2026.9.28: initialize a disposable workspace, install the packed extension, run pm presets apply agent-workflow, then pm health --strict-exit --json. Apply reports success and diff --strict reports inSync=true, but health reports history_drift_workspace_state_mismatch:settings.json. applyPreset writes settings.json directly with fs.writeFileSync, bypassing the SDK audited singleton mutation. All preset entry points share this path."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags[5]: agent-workflow,history,integrity,pm-sdk,settings
created_at: "2026-09-28T22:43:35.841Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-30T05:34:32.527Z"
assignee: codex-presets-settings
claim_principal: codex-presets-settings
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Packed npm/Node and Bun acceptance apply a preset and pass strict PM health; settings changes appear in the verified workspace history; dry-run and failed apply leave both settings and history unchanged; merge and replace semantics remain correct; a missing audited mutation capability fails closed with actionable guidance.
parent: pm-weky
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-30T05:30:31.457Z",codex-presets-settings,"CLI SDK 2026.9.30 implements upstream 1345 and 1346. Package now awaits host-bound mutateWorkspaceSettings, computes the merge under its lock, prevalidates template names, refuses missing capabilities, and uses SDK settings types. Named governance definitions drop ignored derived keys; bug-triage validation agrees with its strict parent policy. Full release gate passes 155 tests with zero skips and 100 lines/branches/functions over its 16-file scope. Statements and whole-repository quality remain owned by pm-915f. Real synthetic initialized trackers verify history, previews, refusal and simultaneous unrelated settings mutation. Template filesystem writes remain separate after the settings commit."
  "2026-09-30T05:34:32.527Z",codex-presets-settings,"Packed tarball acceptance on npm/npx and Bun bunx --bun with CLI 2026.9.30 passed initialization, complete packed extension install, agent-workflow apply, presets diff --strict and strict health. Both runtimes now pass the earlier settings-history and Bun merge-driver failures. Synthetic acceptance logs retained locally. No release or publication approval is implied; pm-915f and exact-head reviews remain gates."
